   "id": 673893,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Discuss the concept of intersectionality and how it applies to the development of identity in early adulthood. Provide examples of how different aspects of identity (e.g., race, gender, sexuality, and religion) intersect and influence each other. How might these intersections create unique challenges or opportunities for identity exploration? You should also reflect on how intersectionality has impacted your own identity development or that of someone you know.",
